  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the Prevention, Detection, and Treatment of Diseases Affecting Us-Bound Refugees and Other Globally Mobile Populations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to conduct an evaluation of a pilot project on latent tuberculosis infection voluntary testing and treatment for United States-bound refugees in the United Republic of Tanzania. This will help to inform the acceptability and feasibility of broader implementation, thereby contributing to improving post-arrival integration for refugees in resettlement and national tuberculosis control efforts.</narrative>
  </description>
